  "label": "Barack Obama is mapped as the candidate offering free food",
  "description": "The top text 'vote for me' directly maps Barack Obama (the visual entity) as the political candidate making a campaign promise. The visual of Obama smiling and looking upward, combined with the text, creates an analogical mapping where the political figure is projected as the entity soliciting votes through the offer of 'free kfc, grape kool aid, & watermelon'. This mapping is reinforced by the campaign setting and the juxtaposition of his image with the satirical, racially coded text.",
